{"id":"babdaf3acc5face1","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-cor-filter.md","title":"Filter Corollary","display":"cor-filter — Filter Corollary","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-cor-filter","aliases":["58-cor-filter"],"display":"cor-filter — Filter Corollary","depends_on":["[[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-cor-filter"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-cor-filter</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-filter — Filter Corollary"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md\">../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md\">../batch09/58-df-powerset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in V\">\\(X\\in V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq X\">\\(A\\subseteq X\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\\)</span> (ultrafilter predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md\">../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}filter} \\vdash U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,X)\\to\\forall A\\subseteq X\\;\\bigl(A\\in U\\lor X\\setminus A\\in U\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}filter} \\vdash U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,X)\\to\\forall A\\subseteq X\\;\\bigl(A\\in U\\lor X\\setminus A\\in U\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>An ultrafilter decides every subset of its base set.</li>\n<li>The assertion uses the set-filter signature built into <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md\">../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md</a>; it does not identify that predicate with the distinct poset-filter predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md","status":"resolved","id":"2b6b1d9eb78a2714","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S$ (ultrafilter predicate, see [[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"The assertion uses the set-filter signature built into [[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]]; it does not identify that predicate with the distinct poset-filter predicate.","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}filter} \\vdash U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,X)\\to\\forall A\\subseteq X\\;\\bigl(A\\in U\\lor X\\setminus A\\in U\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":866,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-53","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-cor-filter.md|58-cor-filter]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","2b6b1d9eb78a2714"]}